{"title":"The Making of a Perfect Martini","link":"https://kottke.org/25/10/the-making-of-a-perfect-martini","date":1760689486000,"content":"\n        <p><img src=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/guy-buffet-martini.jpg\" srcset=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=500,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/guy-buffet-martini.jpg 500w, /cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/guy-buffet-martini.jpg 1200w\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1300\" height=\"1601\" alt=\"Guy Buffet Martini\" /></p>\n\n<p>Artist Guy Buffet has painted <a href=\"https://www.guybuffet.com/gallery/Limited-Edition-Prints/G0000gRfwWbFR9iw/\">a number of different variations</a> of his depiction of how to make various drinks (martini, margarita, Manhattan) but I like <a href=\"https://www.guybuffet.com/gallery-image/Limited-Edition-Prints/G0000gRfwWbFR9iw/I0000XT5fhOfxSBM\">this version</a> the best. (thx, ollie)</p>\n\n        \n\n         <p><strong>Tags:</strong> <a href=\"https://kottke.org/tag/art\">art</a> · <a href=\"https://kottke.org/tag/cocktails\">cocktails</a> · <a href=\"https://kottke.org/tag/food\">food</a> · <a href=\"https://kottke.org/tag/Guy%20Buffet\">Guy Buffet</a></p>\n\n         <p>💬 <a href=\"https://kottke.org/25/10/the-making-of-a-perfect-martini\">Join the discussion on kottke.org</a> →</p>\n\n    ","author":"Jason Kottke","siteTitle":"Kottke","siteHash":"89a883271b4598f9b33ebe87be70d38557bcd266e68aee521a8f93622e0ab723","entryHash":"419ae182474ea0f93cae05dff5aa48ee4f4b69db841d0ed63a63482e83842c48","category":"Sites"}